OL,3,GNEWSAFirst arrest over anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotest in Portsmouth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fviolent disorder and assaulting a
OL,8,Fpolice officer following an
OL,9,Fanti-migrant protest in Portsmouth.
OL,11,FPolice attended Eastney Marina on
OL,12,FSunday night after hundreds of
OL,13,Fdemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,14,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying 120
OL,15,Fmigrants, who had crossed the Channel
OL,16,Fin a dinghy, from leaving the city.
OL,18,FA 42-year-old man from Paulsgrove was
OL,19,Farrested early Friday morning after
OL,20,Fofficers reviewed video from the
OL,21,Fprotest. He remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
